            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "第三十天。梅雨锋面在傍晚退开，天空干净得像被人擦过一遍。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c0d6f7c6-022b-46d7-83ff-7b6e43d99971",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "天台上，她的白发在星空下几乎要和银河混在一起。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "46563556-53f9-4c74-8b96-0f6ae58cdd27",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-hoshino",
            "characterName": "星野",
            "expression": "开心",
            "position": "right",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「观测记录，写完了。三十天，一共 27 页。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "39b2dc3b-7fc4-4bb0-8b97-8f29840df631",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-me",
            "characterName": "我",
            "expression": "",
            "position": "",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": false,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「辛苦了，部员二号。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "a083fc4d-665a-4948-9768-1b804e926e09",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "流星雨开始了。起初是一颗，拖着一根短短的白线，落进城市灯光的尽头。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "59f85ce1-41d2-4370-bf27-a71eeb2217f0",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-hoshino",
            "characterName": "星野",
            "expression": "平静",
            "position": "right",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「我，下周三搬家。北海道，我妈妈的老家。札幌。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2cb48f8e-a206-48f1-9f38-d99a4eabc3cd",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "她说得很轻，像在念别人的观测数据。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "a39d35a0-2de4-4fba-b220-38a8e8942f8d",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-hoshino",
            "characterName": "星野",
            "expression": "害羞",
            "position": "right",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「对不起。三十天的约定，我才想起来要提前还。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "96743743-4cc3-4060-8483-32e6e4a834e6",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-hoshino",
            "characterName": "星野",
            "expression": "害羞",
            "position": "right",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「所以那天晚上我说想看流星……其实是想找一个，就算人走了，也会继续绕回来的约定。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "4ef45e3c-71fc-4702-9b63-4161e4856b55",
      "name": "抉择",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "9f00a3d6-7649-42b6-973c-e2174b097474",
          "type": "branch",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "branchId": "25e02038-d5b2-4444-b10b-6bf9f17845bb",
            "title": "流星雨之夜，我——",
            "choices": "[{\"mode\": \"jump\", \"text\": \"「留下来。」\", \"fragmentId\": \"88782b02-b277-4ea2-8d97-5e77c65ff9b8\"}, {\"mode\": \"jump\", \"text\": \"「我送你走。」\", \"fragmentId\": \"1ee3bcdf-a270-4bca-a690-b3e95e1632fb\"}, {\"mode\": \"jump\", \"text\": \"「……（沉默）」\", \"fragmentId\": \"a9d87bca-f7fb-4a09-b151-c0eea9acd400\"}]"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "88782b02-b277-4ea2-8d97-5e77c65ff9b8",
      "name": "挽留",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "c2c7e965-1bd8-4565-bed6-9e02a29c9b43",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-me",
            "characterName": "我",
            "expression": "",
            "position": "",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": false,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「留下来。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "a3236ca7-78cb-4417-a76c-b7be40ebaf2c",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-me",
            "characterName": "我",
            "expression": "",
            "position": "",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": false,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「天文台还缺一个部员。——我也缺。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "39792674-5af4-4d37-a68c-e6566b23147f",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "话出口的瞬间我就后悔了。哪有这样的理由。可是她转过头来，眼睛比刚才任何一颗流星都亮。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6371325f-1634-4388-865b-82c70a52cc86",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-hoshino",
            "characterName": "星野",
            "expression": "害羞",
            "position": "right",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「……笨蛋。这种事，怎么能拿来当理由。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2d565953-be1f-4325-9b8e-303082e1ae9c",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-hoshino",
            "characterName": "星野",
            "expression": "害羞",
            "position": "right",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「可是——谢谢你。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "f29fadcb-030f-4358-b31d-6ac1e8c0fc43",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "她哭了，又笑了，最后把额头抵在我的肩膀上。流星在头顶一颗一颗地落，像谁在很高的地方撒了一把没说完的话。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "13221272-8d09-4d39-a37e-f621c85ab4bb",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-hoshino",
            "characterName": "星野",
            "expression": "平静",
            "position": "right",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「那，新的约定。」她伸出小指，「十年后的今晚，英仙座极大。就在这里。时间胶囊，一起挖。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cec71032-d7d4-4887-9d30-42b424e669e0",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-me",
            "characterName": "我",
            "expression": "",
            "position": "",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": false,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「一言为定。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "9c48ad79-6a6d-427b-be78-33092fa658b9",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "第二天，我把 27 页观测记录拍在学生会的桌上。废部申请，撤销。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b7d6876a-457c-4c96-9fe2-4ca0e1f35f74",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "那是天文部三十年里，最厚的一份部员成果。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
