        {
          "id": "c836708e-a908-4152-9c68-054c3ca0b61f",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-hoshino",
            "characterName": "星野",
            "expression": "开心",
            "position": "right",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「观测日志我复印了一份，原件你收着。部员一号的义务哦。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "eeafadae-3922-4fcb-a237-a6eb637ebe29",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-hoshino",
            "characterName": "星野",
            "expression": "害羞",
            "position": "right",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「还有这个。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "52c9fce5-d654-401d-8cde-5f18c9cd8fee",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "她把那张手绘星图撕成两半，把有北极星的那半塞进我手里。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "10f8a990-743e-4ccc-b435-0950f2dd1a07",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-hoshino",
            "characterName": "星野",
            "expression": "平静",
            "position": "right",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「剩下半张在我这里。等拼起来的那天——」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "9e08e4b2-8553-4ca6-b1c0-66f25c049e87",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "检票口的铃声响了。她背着大得不成比例的行李走进人群，没有回头。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "a55ea3ee-b819-4e3f-a876-e8631e7dc4f0",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-hoshino",
            "characterName": "星野",
            "expression": "平静",
            "position": "right",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「喂，管理员先生——今年的流星雨，也要看哦。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "f6987158-4ee2-4400-beed-e9b328cb0ccf",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "列车开走了。云缝里，有一颗星亮得不讲道理。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "setver",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
