        {
          "id": "1b29422c-de18-4e8e-ab4b-57606f40ad90",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "天文台如期拆除，改成了储物间。钥匙交了，锁芯换掉之前，我又上去了一次。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6d896470-5b44-454a-b3e1-dd26927b50f3",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "什么都没有。只有水泥地上两个蹭不掉的粉笔圆圈——她画的两把「椅子」。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "46a22a10-5f04-4e58-91f2-d8347724c096",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "很多年后，商店街。人群里有一头白发光了一闪。我们都放慢了半步。然后，都恢复了步速。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "0b2ad085-3844-4039-8655-e2b13d682127",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "星星很守时。人不是。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "7e6cebaa-2bf3-455b-966e-61fc071b0b94",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
